md='''# Current owner native/Parser admission design

This Source-only design creates no executable successor, lease, selected family, native result or Parser permission. The dated family remains **36/45**, with nine roles pending; frozen STEP080 remains **35/45**.

The [complete design](ROOT_NATIVE_PARSER_OWNER_ONLY_COMPATIBILITY_ADMISSION_DESIGN_001.json) defines distinct version2 owner-authority records and exact closed field lists. Genuine Source024 records remain dated provenance. Request32, owner acceptance16 and admission30 are separate future records. No Pro3 response, thread or ACK is fabricated. All actual future values are null; normative required values are specifications, not grants.

The [byte-region contract](ROOT_NATIVE_PARSER_COMPLETE_PROTECTED_ALGORITHM_REGION_CONTRACT_001.json) protects 15 entire Python functions, 47 PowerShell I/O spans, both complete PowerShell mains and the Native8 loop/postread block. Keep all Native10 includingLastAccess, both full independent Python vectors, exact integer FILETIME/UTC7, all caps and one-call/no-retry behavior. Attempt002 changed saved native LastAccess; causeunknown. No normalization or substituted success is proposed.

Static implementation proceeds through common owner validation, lease-producer context, fresh-cohort Source/receipt routes, Native8 helper/wrapper context, then Parser parent/child context. Inert Source authorship does not require a lease. Real invocation separately requires accepted implementation; genuine bounded lease; selected45 identity decision and eight new reviewed phase Sources; Native8 admission/result adoption; Parser purpose/admission/result adoption; then family-specific peer and strong binding. Selecting45 paths does not require45 canonical files before measuring eight.

**Eight genuinely new phase Sources with successor ordinals beyond018 are required.** Their results cannot fill historical phasepeer020 or automatically complete the old36/45. No future ordinal/path is selected here.

Parser stays exactly four ParseFile calls in one owned hidden child under total120/wait110/cleanup10/reap5 seconds, bounded capture and real saved process/results evidence. Protected schema1 INTENT/result/witness leaves and BOUND018 lineage labels remain; actual version2 authority pins/new family still must validate. Protected metadata reads may initialize native support before internal admission, so Root authorization precedes invocation; this design does not pretend otherwise or remove those reads.

After genuine design acceptance, the first implementation task is **I0 owner-support validator/API plus I1 prospective-lease Source context**, under separate static scope. No fixture, C8, actual6, recovery, training or scientific execution follows this design.
'''
mp=O/'NATIVE_PARSER_ADMISSION_DESIGN_001.md'
with mp.open('x',encoding='utf-8',newline='\n') as f:f.write(md)
